{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snapshot Aquarium</strong> is an aquarium sim with <strong>skill-based photo challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's for people who love fish and aquascaping\u2014but want something more engaging than just feeding (or selling) fish every day. It\u2019s calm, but not idle: patience and timing matter.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot with patience:</strong> the photo mechanics reward waiting for the right moment, clean focus, and species combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build cozy habitats:</strong>\u00a0keep your fish thriving and get a higher rank in the online gallery to draw more visitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share &amp; explore:</strong> publish your tank and visit creations from players around the world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A long-term project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've been tinkering on Snapshot Aquariumfor for over 10 years, and I\u2019d love your support to keep adding features for many more. This is a calm, craft-at-your-pace project\u2014built to grow with the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s in the game today</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced fish AI -\u00a0</strong>Schooling, fleeing, feeding, chasing, growing in near-realtime, basic needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aquarium editing -\u00a0</strong>Over 300 items included already</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-style photo challenges </strong>- from easy (auto-aim, auto-focus), to expert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Community</strong> - Share your tank and visit others around the globe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snapshot Gallery</strong> - Share your best shots online</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned / wishlist features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More fish species, more plants, more decorations \u2014 more of everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More creative options (aquascaping)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community photo quests (find the fish!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 and your suggestions are welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love, peace and cheers, <br>Andy / Team Octoponx</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1821550?t=1769459140","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769459140","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821550/39caa8b9b5f1a704629b499d38f8bf17468f3060/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769459140","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821550/39caa8b9b5f1a704629b499d38f8bf17468f3060/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769459140","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3894360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snapshot Aquarium</strong> is an aquarium sim with <strong>skill-based photo challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's for people who love fish and aquascaping\u2014but want something more engaging than just feeding (or selling) fish every day. It\u2019s calm, but not idle: patience and timing matter.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot with patience:</strong> the photo mechanics reward waiting for the right moment, clean focus, and species combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build cozy habitats:</strong>\u00a0keep your fish thriving and get a higher rank in the online gallery to draw more visitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share &amp; explore:</strong> publish your tank and visit creations from players around the world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A long-term project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've been tinkering on Snapshot Aquariumfor for over 10 years, and I\u2019d love your support to keep adding features for many more. This is a calm, craft-at-your-pace project\u2014built to grow with the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s in the game today</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced fish AI -\u00a0</strong>Schooling, fleeing, feeding, chasing, growing in near-realtime, basic needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aquarium editing -\u00a0</strong>Over 300 items included already</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-style photo challenges </strong>- from easy (auto-aim, auto-focus), to expert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Community</strong> - Share your tank and visit others around the globe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snapshot Gallery</strong> - Share your best shots online</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned / wishlist features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More fish species, more plants, more decorations \u2014 more of everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More creative options (aquascaping)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community photo quests (find the fish!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 and your suggestions are welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love, peace and cheers, <br>Andy / Team Octoponx</p>","developers":["Octoponx"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821550/87a43cb706f70ca667beea4d13c989255d6bcaf0/header.jpg?t=1769459140","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1821550/1314786457/4137c7a12d5f60ea8ed2c1b43b2cdfaf5e8dd6ec/1758461850/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760603876","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1821550/1314786457/4137c7a12d5f60ea8ed2c1b43b2cdfaf5e8dd6ec/1758461850/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760603876","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1821550/1314786457/4137c7a12d5f60ea8ed2c1b43b2cdfaf5e8dd6ec/1758461850/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760603876","id":257203309,"name":"Demo Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203309/617978f6edfd7ec4ddf6725b76b0f74f53126416/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760603876"}],"name":"Snapshot Aquarium","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Snapshot Aquarium - $5.99 USD","packageid":655048,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":599}],"title":"Buy Snapshot Aquarium"}],"packages":[655048],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 / Intel Core i5-10400 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon Vega 8 / Intel 